  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1118.03 Incarcerated Children Under the Age of 18. An incarcerated individual under the age of 18 shall have the right to be evaluated, identified, and if appropriate, have special education and related services provided.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
